      <description>&lt;p&gt;५. अन्तरधिकरणम्&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;अन्तस्तद्धर्मोपदेशात् ॥ १.१.२१ ॥&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;छान्दोग्ये प्रथमाध्याये षष्ठखण्डे —&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/vedAH_sAma/tANDyam/ChAndogya-brAhmaNam/ChAndogyopaniShat/rangarAmAnujaH/1/06.md&#34; newLevelForH1=&#34;5&#34; includeTitle=&#34;false&#34;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/vedAH_sAma/tANDyam/ChAndogya-brAhmaNam/ChAndogyopaniShat/rangarAmAnujaH/1/07.md&#34; newLevelForH1=&#34;5&#34; includeTitle=&#34;false&#34;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
