      <description>&lt;ol start=&#34;6&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;आकाशाधिकरणम् ।&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;आकाशस् तल्-लिङ्गात् (ब्र.सू.1.1.23)&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;छान्दोग्ये प्रथम-प्रपाठके ऽष्टम-खण्डे ।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/vedAH_sAma/tANDyam/ChAndogya-brAhmaNam/ChAndogyopaniShat/rangarAmAnujaH/1/08.md&#34; newLevelForH1=&#34;5&#34; includeTitle=&#34;false&#34;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/vedAH_sAma/tANDyam/ChAndogya-brAhmaNam/ChAndogyopaniShat/rangarAmAnujaH/1/09.md&#34; newLevelForH1=&#34;5&#34; includeTitle=&#34;false&#34;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
